  "body": "Forget the renovation projects, weekend gardening and endless to-do lists. This beautifully presented, single-level home is modern, immaculate and just a 600-metre stroll from Stanmore Bay Beach. Set against a backdrop of mature trees and bird song, it offers a peaceful setting to come home to. \r\n\r\nInside, three generous double bedrooms are complemented by a gorgeous kitchen and bathroom, blending country-style charm with modern features. Outside, the landscaped, fully fenced section is easy to care for, while louvre-covered outdoor living areas give you the choice of sunshine or shelter. With our sellers heading to Australia, this is a genuine opportunity to secure a home where there's nothing left to do but enjoy.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Three generous double bedrooms\r\n* Single-level living with a practical, easy-flow layout\r\n* Modern kitchen and bathroom with country style charm \r\n* HRV ventilation system\r\n* Louvre-covered outdoor entertaining areas\r\n* Immaculately landscaped, low-maintenance gardens\r\n* Fully fenced section, ideal for pets\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Private outlook backing onto a tree-clad reserve and walkway\r\n* Convenient to shopping centres and all amenities\r\n* Walking distance to school and daycare \r\n\r\nThere's even a back gate opening onto the neighbouring reserve and walkway. It's a location that makes everyday life easy, whether you're walking the kids over to Stanmore school, or the nearby daycare, heading down to the beach or simply enjoying the peace and privacy of your surroundings. With Penlink progressing and set to improve connectivity to this sought-after coastal community, now is a great time to buy here. \r\n\r\nIf you've been waiting for a beautifully maintained, move-in-ready home where the beach, schools and relaxed coastal living are all within easy reach, don't let this one pass you by. \r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 10th December from 3:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/RJVE \r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
